description	"Smuggler Ace

An exceptionally nimble underworld scoundrel who relies on quick reflexes, custom blasters, and evasive maneuvers over light armor.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- 5% Faster RoF
- Vibrocutlass
-- Cutlass (Medium)
-- Saber Defense (1)
- Thermal Grenades (5)

^8Attributes:
- Assemble (1)
- Dexterity (3) ^3[CS1]
- Faster Skill Cooldowns (15% reduction)
- Binoculars
- Tracking Beacon
- Environmental Suit (1)
- Tracking Darts (4) ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4]

^8Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"